@startuml gap_to_email
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

title Gap-to-Email Pipeline

participant "Frontend\n(Gap-to-Email Tab)" as FE
participant "API\n(/gap-to-email)" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n+ OpenSearch" as DB
participant "Amazon\nBedrock" as AI

FE -> API : POST /gap-to-email\n{form_doc_id, vendors[], context_docs[], example_email}

group For each vendor (alphabetical)
    API -> DB : Get form document chunks
    API -> DB : Get context document chunks\n(standards, guidelines)
    API -> DB : Get vendor document chunks

    API -> API : Build prompt:\n• Form requirements\n• Vendor's existing docs\n• ARB standards context\n• Example email (if provided)

    API -> AI : Converse (generate model)\n"Analyze gaps + write email"
    AI --> API : Gaps[] + Email text

    API -> API : Parse GAPS: and EMAIL:\nsections from response
end

API --> FE : {results: [{vendor_name,\ncontact, gaps[], email}]}

FE -> FE : Render per-vendor cards:\n• Gap list (amber)\n• Email (monospace)\n• Copy button

@enduml
